*Formula Sheet: Hydrogen Atom & Spherical Coordinates*

- *Hydrogen Ground State Wavefunction (1s):*
  $ psi_(1, 0, 0)(r, theta, phi) = 1/sqrt(pi a_0^3) e^(-r/a_0) $

- *Spherical Coordinates Integration:*
  $ d V = r^2 sin(theta) d r d theta d phi $
  - For spherically symmetric wavefunctions ($psi = psi(r)$):
    $ P(a <= r <= b) = integral_a^b 4 pi r^2 |psi(r)|^2 d r $

- *Hydrogen Energy Spectrum:*
  $ E_n = - (13.6 " eV")/n^2 $

- *Bohr Radius:*
  $ a_0 = (4 pi epsilon_0 planck^2)/(m_e e^2) approx 0.529 text(" Å") $
